tests/golden/check/function-type-marks-an-extern-with-a-mark-is-no-value.hero:21:9: error[mutable_parameter_as_value]: `frexp` is a C function of an `extern` group, and its `@e` is C's out-parameter, the place C writes: a function of a group with an `@` parameter, or a record `lent`, is no value, its marks being C's (§ 9, § 13), so `frexp` is called by name
tests/golden/check/function-type-marks-an-extern-with-a-mark-is-no-value.hero:22:9: error[lent_parameter_as_value]: `asctime` is a C function of an `extern` group, and its `t` is lent to C in place, C's pointer to const: a function of a group with a parameter `lent` so, or one `@`, is no value, its marks being C's (§ 9, § 13), so `asctime` is called by name
